ags-cd N/Untangle
stack >NIL: 65536
IF EXISTS WHDSaves:Untangle/Untangle.state
  copy WHDSaves:Untangle/Untangle.state Untangle.state QUIET
ENDIF
Untangle >NIL:
ags-cd N/Untangle
IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:Untangle
  makedir WHDSaves:Untangle
ENDIF
IF EXISTS Untangle.state
  copy Untangle.state WHDSaves:Untangle/Untangle.state QUIET
ENDIF
